["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"aep","stream_identity":"01a0d3bf-067c-7068-af65-bd964ce78fcb","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"story","fields":{"body":"# Story: Two stores agree on the order of an artifact's relations\n\n## Context\n\nAfter `relate`, `unrelate`, then `relate` again, the markdown backend lists the edge where the line\nwas appended and the SQLite backend lists it where its new relation id falls. `aep plan artifact\nshow <id>` therefore prints the relations in a different order depending on which store answered,\nfor the same sequence of commands.\n\nFound while implementing `unrelate` (0.53.0).\n`crates/edge/aep-cli/tests/store_selection.rs` currently asserts each store separately at that\npoint, with a comment saying why, rather than comparing one store's answer with the other's.\n\n## Acceptance\n\nOne ordering rule is decided and written down, both backends produce it, and\n`store_selection.rs` compares the two stores' `show` output directly instead of asserting them\napart.\n","document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"ent-5cb5f960f92e8e02a4a07e3298c8efa9","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/relations-order-is-the-same-in-every-store","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":1,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"# Story: Two stores agree on the order of an artifact's relations\n\n## Context\n\nAfter `relate`, `unrelate`, then `relate` again, the markdown backend lists the edge where the line\nwas appended and the SQLite backend lists it where its new relation id falls. `aep plan artifact\nshow <id>` therefore prints the relations in a different order depending on which store answered,\nfor the same sequence of commands.\n\nFound while implementing `unrelate` (0.53.0).\n`crates/edge/aep-cli/tests/store_selection.rs` currently asserts each store separately at that\npoint, with a comment saying why, rather than comparing one store's answer with the other's.\n\n## Acceptance\n\nOne ordering rule is decided and written down, both backends produce it, and\n`store_selection.rs` compares the two stores' `show` output directly instead of asserting them\napart.\n","relations":[{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"status":"draft","summary":"markdown appends, SQLite orders by relation id, so show disagrees after a remove and re-relate.","title":"Two stores agree on the order of an artifact's relations"},"lifecycle_state":"draft"},"relations":[{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"summary":"markdown appends, SQLite orders by relation id, so show disagrees after a remove and re-relate.","title":"Two stores agree on the order of an artifact's relations"},"id":"ent-5cb5f960f92e8e02a4a07e3298c8efa9","lifecycle_state":"draft","revision":1,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["story","ent-5cb5f960f92e8e02a4a07e3298c8efa9"]}]